  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>123</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>1234</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>123</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>1234</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then least value&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
